{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-02-06 07:58:59 UTC] [Agent: Scribe] [Project: scribe_pro_cleanup] Created research report: RESEARCH_SECURITY_AUDIT_20260206_0758.md | action=create; agent_id=Scribe; agent_name=Scribe; audit_date=2026-02-06; doc=research_report; doc_name=RESEARCH_SECURITY_AUDIT_20260206_0758; doc_type=research; document_type=research_report; file_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/research/RESEARCH_SECURITY_AUDIT_20260206_0758.md; file_size=2040; project_name=scribe_pro_cleanup; project_root=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp; research_goal=Comprehensive security audit of Scribe MCP production codebase; researcher=Scribe; scope=SQL injection, path traversal, hardcoded secrets, input validation, dependencies, file permissions, error leakage, authentication, deserialization, log injection; section=; severity=critical; timestamp=2026-02-06 07:58:59 UTC; title=Research Security Audit 20260206 0758; vulnerabilities_found=5; priority=medium; log_type=doc_updates; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_pro_cleanup/DOC_LOG.md", "id": "2026-02-06T07:58:59.249810+00:00_7e4ed4ec", "timestamp": "2026-02-06T07:58:59.249881+00:00"}
